#N canvas 0 0 450 240 10;
#X obj 42 47 inlet~;
#X obj 42 100 outlet~;
#X obj 120 60 loadbang;
#X obj 120 100 metro 100;
#X obj 120 140 snapshot~;
#X obj 120 180 send pocketpd-display~;
#X obj 120 210 send $1;
#X text 190 60 display~ - show the signal value in the widget. The PocketPd canvas shows the live sample (100 ms) inside this box\; the signal passes through untouched. The app gives every display~ a unique receive tag (creation arg 1\, the [send $1] above)\; a bare [display~] from an imported patch mirrors the shared pocketpd-display~ channel;
#X connect 0 0 1 0;
#X connect 0 0 4 0;
#X connect 2 0 3 0;
#X connect 3 0 4 0;
#X connect 4 0 5 0;
#X connect 4 0 6 0;
